Node ID=900 order templar unknelt killer
Text=The Knights Templar came out of the siege with their chapter houses standing and their numbers halved, and no benefactor ever came to collect on them. You had killed men who wore the same cross you did, and then you spared the whole order by talking its creditor into its own death, which is not a thing the rolls have a line for. They rebuilt slowly, under their own banners and out of their own treasury. The brothers who had buried the men you killed argued with the brothers who had read the Alamut dispatches, and they argued for as long as any of them lived, and the order never settled it.
Should Have Voiceover=1

