Node ID=900 order templar unknelt
Text=The Knights Templar came out of the siege with their chapter houses standing and their numbers halved, and no benefactor ever came for them. You had taken their oath, and you had talked the thing that meant to collect on it into its own death before it ever reached a chapter house. The order rebuilt slowly, under its own banners and out of its own treasury, and for a generation it was poorer than it had been in two hundred years. No record was ever written of what you spared them, because the only men who could have written it were standing at Alamut and did not understand what they had heard.
