Node ID=900 order inquisition
Text=The Inquisition came out of the siege with the most intact command structure left in Barcelona, and the city handed it the rebuilding. You had worn its mark and done its work, and for a few years afterward the mark was worth a good deal more than the work had been. It opened doors in the new Barcelona, and then it went on opening doors you had stopped wanting to walk through. Its fires burned on through the peace exactly as they had burned through the war, and the cities paid for the wood. You stopped wearing the mark somewhere in the third year, and nobody ever came to ask you why.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
