Node ID=900 order wielder ring
Text=La Calle Perdida was never found, because by the end of that year there was nothing left of it to find. You put on Relican's ring and turned it on the hidden city yourself, and the few who walked out gave you the only title that fit, which was Dark Lord of a place that no longer existed. What the Church had spent three hundred years failing to drown, you buried in an afternoon. The Tome of Geomancy went down with it, the Five Ways crystals were never gathered again, and nobody taught any of it in the open, then or afterward.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=
Custom Action=CTriggerRelayAction
{
Relay Name=Fixt order epilogue relay
}
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order wielder exposed
Text=La Calle Perdida was found, and it was found because you told the Inquisition where to look. You had been inside as a friend first, which is the only reason your directions were good enough to act on. The Holy Office took the quarter apart over nine days, and what the Wielders had kept hidden for a century was catalogued, carted out and burned in the open. Cedric's library went in the third load. A handful got away through the sewers and taught what they could remember to people who did not understand what they were being given, and inside two generations it was gone.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
