------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=900 order wielder high
Text=La Calle Perdida was never found, not by the Inquisition and not by the knights, and after the siege it took in more of Barcelona's unwanted than it had room for. You had risen high among the Wielders, a scion of Richard's line who chose the sorcerers over the cross, and that choice was argued over in both houses for a century. The magic the Church had tried to drown went on breathing under the streets, and was taught in the open again long after everyone who had hidden it was dead. When it was, the first teachers cited you, and got the details wrong.
Should Have Voiceover=1

