Node ID=900 order wielder
Text=La Calle Perdida was never found, not by the Inquisition and not by the knights, and after the siege it took in more of Barcelona's unwanted than it had room for. You had walked the hidden city as a friend, and the Wielders put your name somewhere the Inquisition's archive was never going to reach it. The magic the Church had tried to drown went on breathing under the streets, and was taught in the open again long after everyone who had hidden it was dead. You were welcome there for the rest of your life. You went back twice.
